{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1443917-solar-athletics-revamp","id":1443917,"title":"Solar Athletics Revamp","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-04-14T12:41:45-07:00","id":1443917,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon1.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Solar Athletics Revamp","content":"I\u2019ve revamped Solar Athletics into a more streamlined set. I\u2019ve made some clarifications to the Athletics ability as a whole and condensed the charms; charms that expand your capabilities are condensed, things are rebalanced (I.E, Thunderbolt Attack Prana is no longer an abomination against God), and you no longer have a half dozen charms that only do things such as give you motes or initiative. I\u2019ve also brought back some old favorites, such as a charm to let your battlegroup share certain Athletics charms or new charms such as a charm that gives your advantages while swimming underwater.<br /> <br /> As usual, let me know what you think.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/155sZ0F7GYw7dv2gYek4HOxdtNRnYJZ5kSvzt6nuh5e0/edit#\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/155sZ0F7GYw7dv2gYek4HOxdtNRnYJZ5kSvzt6nuh5e0/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/155sZ0F7GYw7dv2gYek4HOxdtNRnYJZ5kSvzt6nuh5e0/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/155sZ0F7GYw7dv2gYek4HOxdtNRnYJZ5kSvzt6nuh5e0/edit# </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"